Consider the following C function. <pre><code>int fun1(int n){
    int i,j,k,p,q=0;
    for (i=1; i < n; ++i) {
        p=0;
        for (j=n; j > 1; j=j/2)
              ++p;
        for (k=1; k < p; k=k*2) 
             ++q;
        }
    return q;
} </pre></code> Which one of the following most closely approximates the return value of the function fun1?
